# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# AI agents and local assistant state
#
# No AI-assistant file is ever versioned: instructions, rules, prompts, memory,
# local settings, caches, or generated knowledge graphs. This includes
# AGENTS.md. `pnpm lint:ai-files` fails CI if any of these is tracked, even if
# it was added with `git add -f`.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
